{"id": "1472946812703735930", "channel_id": "1426837316533747823", "author_id": "633215996508766229", "author_name": "game.producer.light", "content": "When Mythag welcomes the Spring Festival, it also coincides with Lunar New Year in our real world.\n\nDuring this special holiday, the members of B.I.A.V. Studio have stepped away from our usual work routines and returned to our families. After a short break, we’ll get back to work on Morimens. \n\nWith that, we wish all Keepers a wonderful Spring Festival!\n\n当弥萨格迎来祈岁节之时，我们现实世界也恰逢农历新年。\n\n在这个特别的节日里，脑缸组成员们暂时从日常工作中抽身，回到家人身边。短暂休整之后，我们也将重新投入到《忘却前夜》的创作旅程中。\n\n在此，祝所有守密人祈岁节快乐！", "timestamp": "2026-02-16T13:24:46.177000+00:00", "edited_timestamp": "2026-02-16T13:24:58.776000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Heart", "emoji_id": "1409464250115690518", "count": 54}, {"emoji": "PandiaLove", "emoji_id": "1439369272609472663", "count": 29}, {"emoji": "Hameln_love", "emoji_id": "1468257934348783749", "count": 21}, {"emoji": "Corpo_advance", "emoji_id": "1459080545882341376", "count": 18}, {"emoji": "🦐", "emoji_id": null, "count": 8}, {"emoji": "gdoll_evil_laugh", "emoji_id": "1468257456948908094", "count": 6}, {"emoji": "🎉", "emoji_id": null, "count": 11}, {"emoji": "🫶", "emoji_id": null, "count": 7}, {"emoji": "🐴", "emoji_id": null, "count": 5}, {"emoji": "🫃", "emoji_id": null, "count": 3}], "attachments": [{"id": "1472946812783562873", "filename": "457F1354-E3F6-4FC8-98F7-2DBEDC6DE30E-8549-000003D5F3D8AECC.png", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 555072, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1426837316533747823/1472946812783562873/457F1354-E3F6-4FC8-98F7-2DBEDC6DE30E-8549-000003D5F3D8AECC.png?ex=6ac2539e&is=6ac1021e&hm=691bf05cfdc0560f08c0b0987559dbfae1bfee8d847e5191d32649fbe15fa148&"}, {"id": "1472946813089615895", "filename": "4BE7EFD5-D7D5-43C5-AD87-36A8B4D6BD80-1469-0000016BA38FA6B8.png", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 957544, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1426837316533747823/1472946813089